{"id":"63e260cd8847a6b6","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-identity-relative-equality.md","title":"两层理解结构的相等强度","display":"df-identity-relative-equality — 两层理解结构的相等强度","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"11","label":"16-df-identity-relative-equality","aliases":["16-df-identity-relative-equality"],"display":"df-identity-relative-equality — 两层理解结构的相等强度","depends_on":["[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]","[[16-df-comprehension-category]]","[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]","[[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]"],"source":"Definition 11.4.10, p. 682 (PDF 702); Exercise 11.4.3, p. 683 (PDF 703)","review_status":"source-definition-reconstructed","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"11"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-identity-relative-equality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-identity-relative-equality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-identity-relative-equality — 两层理解结构的相等强度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0ba8f021ca287877\" href=\"?note=0ba8f021ca287877\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-category\">16-df-comprehension-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"86e53aa076639692\" href=\"?note=86e53aa076639692\" title=\"16-df-beck-chevalley\">16-df-beck-chevalley</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"427be4d627513590\" href=\"?note=427be4d627513590\" title=\"16-df-cartesian-morphism\">16-df-cartesian-morphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 11.4.10, p. 682 (PDF 702); Exercise 11.4.3, p. 683 (PDF 703)"},{"key":"review_status","html":"source-definition-reconstructed"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}\">\\(P:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}\">\\(Q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}\\)</span> 是同底的理解范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p=\\operatorname{cod}P\">\\(p=\\operatorname{cod}P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q=\\operatorname{cod}Q\">\\(q=\\operatorname{cod}Q\\)</span>；每个纤维化选定笛卡尔提升。理解范畴的公理见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0ba8f021ca287877\" href=\"?note=0ba8f021ca287877\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-category\">16-df-comprehension-category</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_X=P(X):\\{X\\}_P\\to pX\">\\(\\pi_X=P(X):\\{X\\}_P\\to pX\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_Y=Q(Y):\\{Y\\}_Q\\to qY\">\\(\\pi_Y=Q(Y):\\{Y\\}_Q\\to qY\\)</span>，理解函子的箭头分量记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{f\\}_P,\\{g\\}_Q\">\\(\\{f\\}_P,\\{g\\}_Q\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X&#39;=\\pi_X^*X\">\\(X&#39;=\\pi_X^*X\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline\\pi_{X,X}:X&#39;\\to X\">\\(\\overline\\pi_{X,X}:X&#39;\\to X\\)</span> 是所选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>-笛卡尔提升。理解拉回保证下式的两个唯一描述有且仅有一个解；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 表示唯一描述。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X_0\\to X_1\">\\(f:X_0\\to X_1\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p\">\\(\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p\\)</span> 的实际定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"427be4d627513590\" href=\"?note=427be4d627513590\" title=\"16-df-cartesian-morphism\">16-df-cartesian-morphism</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(q;S_f)\">\\(\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(q;S_f)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"86e53aa076639692\" href=\"?note=86e53aa076639692\" title=\"16-df-beck-chevalley\">16-df-beck-chevalley</a>，其带参数形式取下文的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Eq}_X,\\Phi^{\\mathfrak e}_X\">\\(\\mathsf{Eq}_X,\\Phi^{\\mathfrak e}_X\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dashv_{\\eta,\\epsilon}\">\\(\\dashv_{\\eta,\\epsilon}\\)</span> 的自然变换与三角律定义采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak e=(\\mathsf{Eq}_X,\\eta^X,\\epsilon^X)_{X\\in\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\mathfrak e=(\\mathsf{Eq}_X,\\eta^X,\\epsilon^X)_{X\\in\\mathcal E}\\)</span> 是候选数据族：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Eq}_X:\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}_P}\\to\\mathcal D_{\\{X^{\\prime}\\}_P}\">\\(\\mathsf{Eq}_X:\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}_P}\\to\\mathcal D_{\\{X^{\\prime}\\}_P}\\)</span> 是函子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta^X:\\operatorname{Id}\\Rightarrow\\delta_X^*\\mathsf{Eq}_X\">\\(\\eta^X:\\operatorname{Id}\\Rightarrow\\delta_X^*\\mathsf{Eq}_X\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon^X:\\mathsf{Eq}_X\\delta_X^*\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}\">\\(\\epsilon^X:\\mathsf{Eq}_X\\delta_X^*\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}\\)</span> 是对应纤维中的自然变换；这里尚未假定三角律或BC。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline\\delta_{X,Z}:\\delta_X^*Z\\to Z\">\\(\\overline\\delta_{X,Z}:\\delta_X^*Z\\to Z\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 中沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_X\">\\(\\delta_X\\)</span> 的所选笛卡尔箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\in\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}_P}\">\\(Y\\in\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}_P}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(B\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span>；下式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v,d\">\\(u,v,d\\)</span> 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 箭头。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelWeakEq}\">\\(\\mathrm{RelWeakEq}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelStrongEq}\">\\(\\mathrm{RelStrongEq}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelVeryStrongEq}\">\\(\\mathrm{RelVeryStrongEq}\\)</span> 是本原子待定义的三元结构谓词，其完整参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P,Q;\\mathfrak e)\">\\((P,Q;\\mathfrak e)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"d_X^0\\coloneqq\\pi_{X&#39;},\\qquad d_X^1\\coloneqq\\{\\overline\\pi_{X,X}\\}_P,\\qquad\n\\delta_X\\coloneqq\\iota d\\in\\mathcal B(\\{X\\}_P,\\{X&#39;\\}_P)\\quad\nd_X^0d=1_{\\{X\\}_P}\\land d_X^1d=1_{\\{X\\}_P}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[d_X^0\\coloneqq\\pi_{X&#39;},\\qquad d_X^1\\coloneqq\\{\\overline\\pi_{X,X}\\}_P,\\qquad\n\\delta_X\\coloneqq\\iota d\\in\\mathcal B(\\{X\\}_P,\\{X&#39;\\}_P)\\quad\nd_X^0d=1_{\\{X\\}_P}\\land d_X^1d=1_{\\{X\\}_P}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"w_f\\coloneqq\\{f\\}_P,\\qquad\nb_f\\coloneqq\\iota b\\in\\mathcal B(\\{X&#39;_0\\}_P,\\{X&#39;_1\\}_P)\\quad\nd_{X_1}^0b=w_fd_{X_0}^0\\land d_{X_1}^1b=w_fd_{X_0}^1,\\qquad\nS_f\\coloneqq(w_f,\\delta_{X_0},\\delta_{X_1},b_f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[w_f\\coloneqq\\{f\\}_P,\\qquad\nb_f\\coloneqq\\iota b\\in\\mathcal B(\\{X&#39;_0\\}_P,\\{X&#39;_1\\}_P)\\quad\nd_{X_1}^0b=w_fd_{X_0}^0\\land d_{X_1}^1b=w_fd_{X_0}^1,\\qquad\nS_f\\coloneqq(w_f,\\delta_{X_0},\\delta_{X_1},b_f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Phi^{\\mathfrak e}_{X,A,B}:\\mathcal D_{\\{X&#39;\\}_P}(\\mathsf{Eq}_XA,B)&amp;\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}_P}(A,\\delta_X^*B),\\\\\n\\Phi^{\\mathfrak e}_{X,A,B}(h)&amp;\\coloneqq\\delta_X^*(h)\\circ\\eta^X_A\n\\quad\\bigl(A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}_P},\\ B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal D_{\\{X&#39;\\}_P}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Phi^{\\mathfrak e}_{X,A,B}:\\mathcal D_{\\{X&#39;\\}_P}(\\mathsf{Eq}_XA,B)&amp;\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}_P}(A,\\delta_X^*B),\\\\\n\\Phi^{\\mathfrak e}_{X,A,B}(h)&amp;\\coloneqq\\delta_X^*(h)\\circ\\eta^X_A\n\\quad\\bigl(A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}_P},\\ B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal D_{\\{X&#39;\\}_P}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelWeakEq}(P,Q;\\mathfrak e)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E\\quad\n\\mathsf{Eq}_X:\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}_P}\\to\\mathcal D_{\\{X&#39;\\}_P}\\dashv_{\\eta^X,\\epsilon^X}\\delta_X^*\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall X_0,X_1\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\\ \\forall f\\in\\{g\\in\\mathcal E(X_0,X_1)\\mid\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(g)\\}\\quad\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(q;S_f;\\mathsf{Eq}_{X_0},\\Phi^{\\mathfrak e}_{X_0},\\mathsf{Eq}_{X_1},\\Phi^{\\mathfrak e}_{X_1})\\bigr)\\Bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RelWeakEq}(P,Q;\\mathfrak e)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E\\quad\n\\mathsf{Eq}_X:\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}_P}\\to\\mathcal D_{\\{X&#39;\\}_P}\\dashv_{\\eta^X,\\epsilon^X}\\delta_X^*\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall X_0,X_1\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\\ \\forall f\\in\\{g\\in\\mathcal E(X_0,X_1)\\mid\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(g)\\}\\quad\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(q;S_f;\\mathsf{Eq}_{X_0},\\Phi^{\\mathfrak e}_{X_0},\\mathsf{Eq}_{X_1},\\Phi^{\\mathfrak e}_{X_1})\\bigr)\\Bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"k_{X,Y}\\coloneqq\\overline\\delta_{X,\\mathsf{Eq}_XY}\\circ\\eta^X_Y,\n\\qquad K_{X,Y}\\coloneqq\\{k_{X,Y}\\}_Q,\n\\qquad\\pi_{\\mathsf{Eq}_XY}K_{X,Y}=\\delta_X\\pi_Y.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[k_{X,Y}\\coloneqq\\overline\\delta_{X,\\mathsf{Eq}_XY}\\circ\\eta^X_Y,\n\\qquad K_{X,Y}\\coloneqq\\{k_{X,Y}\\}_Q,\n\\qquad\\pi_{\\mathsf{Eq}_XY}K_{X,Y}=\\delta_X\\pi_Y.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RelStrongEq}(P,Q;\\mathfrak e)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{RelWeakEq}(P,Q;\\mathfrak e)\\land\n\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E\\ \\forall Y\\in\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}_P}\\ \\forall B\\in\\mathcal D\\\\\n&amp;\\forall u:\\{Y\\}_Q\\to\\{B\\}_Q\\ \\forall v:\\{\\mathsf{Eq}_XY\\}_Q\\to qB\\\\\n&amp;\\Bigl(\\pi_Bu=vK_{X,Y}\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists!d:\\{\\mathsf{Eq}_XY\\}_Q\\to\\{B\\}_Q\\quad\ndK_{X,Y}=u\\land\\pi_Bd=v\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RelVeryStrongEq}(P,Q;\\mathfrak e)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{RelWeakEq}(P,Q;\\mathfrak e)\\land\n\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E\\ \\forall Y\\in\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}_P}\\\\\n&amp;\\exists H:\\{\\mathsf{Eq}_XY\\}_Q\\to\\{Y\\}_Q\\quad\nHK_{X,Y}=1_{\\{Y\\}_Q}\\land K_{X,Y}H=1_{\\{\\mathsf{Eq}_XY\\}_Q}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RelStrongEq}(P,Q;\\mathfrak e)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{RelWeakEq}(P,Q;\\mathfrak e)\\land\n\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E\\ \\forall Y\\in\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}_P}\\ \\forall B\\in\\mathcal D\\\\\n&amp;\\forall u:\\{Y\\}_Q\\to\\{B\\}_Q\\ \\forall v:\\{\\mathsf{Eq}_XY\\}_Q\\to qB\\\\\n&amp;\\Bigl(\\pi_Bu=vK_{X,Y}\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists!d:\\{\\mathsf{Eq}_XY\\}_Q\\to\\{B\\}_Q\\quad\ndK_{X,Y}=u\\land\\pi_Bd=v\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RelVeryStrongEq}(P,Q;\\mathfrak e)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{RelWeakEq}(P,Q;\\mathfrak e)\\land\n\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E\\ \\forall Y\\in\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}_P}\\\\\n&amp;\\exists H:\\{\\mathsf{Eq}_XY\\}_Q\\to\\{Y\\}_Q\\quad\nHK_{X,Y}=1_{\\{Y\\}_Q}\\land K_{X,Y}H=1_{\\{\\mathsf{Eq}_XY\\}_Q}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：Definition 11.4.10，p. 682（PDF 702）；Exercise 11.4.3，p. 683（PDF 703）。强相等要求规范比较箭头与所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>-理解投影正交；很强相等要求这些比较箭头可逆。</li>\n<li>本原子复用本目录的理解范畴与 Beck–Chevalley 公理，内建了两层相对相等所需的全部额外数据及正交公式。新增原因：<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3791ea7b3d0077ae\" href=\"?note=3791ea7b3d0077ae\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-equality\">16-df-comprehension-equality</a> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ec6ba39693a55895\" href=\"?note=ec6ba39693a55895\" title=\"16-df-strong-equality\">16-df-strong-equality</a> 只有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=Q\">\\(P=Q\\)</span> 的一层签名，不能直接表达本节两层相对关系；检索本目录 identity/equality 原子后没有发现相同签名。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=Q\">\\(P=Q\\)</span> 时强与很强相等一致（Exercise 11.4.3），这解释了 §10.5 的一层命名；这里没有将两层的一般 strong 等同于 canonical map 可逆。</li>\n<li>谓词随所选伴随族解释；换成同构伴随族时其条件不变。这里是结构定义，没有声称任意所选结构都存在，也没有替代尚需验证的语法—模型对应。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-category","status":"resolved","id":"0ba8f021ca287877","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-comprehension-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-beck-chevalley","status":"resolved","id":"86e53aa076639692","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cartesian-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"427be4d627513590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-category","status":"resolved","id":"0ba8f021ca287877","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}$ 与 $Q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}$ 是同底的理解范畴，$p=\\operatorname{cod}P$、$q=\\operatorname{cod}Q$；每个纤维化选定笛卡尔提升。理解范畴的公理见 [[16-df-comprehension-category]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cartesian-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"427be4d627513590","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:X_0\\to X_1$ 是 $\\mathcal E$ 箭头。$\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p$ 的实际定义见 [[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]。$\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(q;S_f)$ 采用 [[16-df-beck-chevalley]]，其带参数形式取下文的 $\\mathsf{Eq}_X,\\Phi^{\\mathfrak e}_X$。$\\dashv_{\\eta,\\epsilon}$ 的自然变换与三角律定义采用 [[16-df-adjoint-functors]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-beck-chevalley","status":"resolved","id":"86e53aa076639692","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:X_0\\to X_1$ 是 $\\mathcal E$ 箭头。$\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p$ 的实际定义见 [[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]。$\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(q;S_f)$ 采用 [[16-df-beck-chevalley]]，其带参数形式取下文的 $\\mathsf{Eq}_X,\\Phi^{\\mathfrak e}_X$。$\\dashv_{\\eta,\\epsilon}$ 的自然变换与三角律定义采用 [[16-df-adjoint-functors]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:X_0\\to X_1$ 是 $\\mathcal E$ 箭头。$\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p$ 的实际定义见 [[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]。$\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(q;S_f)$ 采用 [[16-df-beck-chevalley]]，其带参数形式取下文的 $\\mathsf{Eq}_X,\\Phi^{\\mathfrak e}_X$。$\\dashv_{\\eta,\\epsilon}$ 的自然变换与三角律定义采用 [[16-df-adjoint-functors]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-equality","status":"resolved","id":"3791ea7b3d0077ae","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本原子复用本目录的理解范畴与 Beck–Chevalley 公理，内建了两层相对相等所需的全部额外数据及正交公式。新增原因：[[16-df-comprehension-equality]] 与 [[16-df-strong-equality]] 只有 $P=Q$ 的一层签名，不能直接表达本节两层相对关系；检索本目录 identity/equality 原子后没有发现相同签名。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-strong-equality","status":"resolved","id":"ec6ba39693a55895","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本原子复用本目录的理解范畴与 Beck–Chevalley 公理，内建了两层相对相等所需的全部额外数据及正交公式。新增原因：[[16-df-comprehension-equality]] 与 [[16-df-strong-equality]] 只有 $P=Q$ 的一层签名，不能直接表达本节两层相对关系；检索本目录 identity/equality 原子后没有发现相同签名。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"P:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}","display":false},{"tex":"Q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}","display":false},{"tex":"p=\\operatorname{cod}P","display":false},{"tex":"q=\\operatorname{cod}Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_X=P(X):\\{X\\}_P\\to pX","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_Y=Q(Y):\\{Y\\}_Q\\to qY","display":false},{"tex":"\\{f\\}_P,\\{g\\}_Q","display":false},{"tex":"X'=\\pi_X^*X","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline\\pi_{X,X}:X'\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"f:X_0\\to X_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(q;S_f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Eq}_X,\\Phi^{\\mathfrak e}_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\dashv_{\\eta,\\epsilon}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak e=(\\mathsf{Eq}_X,\\eta^X,\\epsilon^X)_{X\\in\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Eq}_X:\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}_P}\\to\\mathcal D_{\\{X^{\\prime}\\}_P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta^X:\\operatorname{Id}\\Rightarrow\\delta_X^*\\mathsf{Eq}_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon^X:\\mathsf{Eq}_X\\delta_X^*\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline\\delta_{X,Z}:\\delta_X^*Z\\to Z","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_X","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\in\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}_P}","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"u,v,d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelWeakEq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelStrongEq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelVeryStrongEq}","display":false},{"tex":"(P,Q;\\mathfrak e)","display":false},{"tex":"d_X^0\\coloneqq\\pi_{X'},\\qquad d_X^1\\coloneqq\\{\\overline\\pi_{X,X}\\}_P,\\qquad\n\\delta_X\\coloneqq\\iota d\\in\\mathcal B(\\{X\\}_P,\\{X'\\}_P)\\quad\nd_X^0d=1_{\\{X\\}_P}\\land d_X^1d=1_{\\{X\\}_P}.","display":true},{"tex":"w_f\\coloneqq\\{f\\}_P,\\qquad\nb_f\\coloneqq\\iota b\\in\\mathcal B(\\{X'_0\\}_P,\\{X'_1\\}_P)\\quad\nd_{X_1}^0b=w_fd_{X_0}^0\\land d_{X_1}^1b=w_fd_{X_0}^1,\\qquad\nS_f\\coloneqq(w_f,\\delta_{X_0},\\delta_{X_1},b_f).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Phi^{\\mathfrak e}_{X,A,B}:\\mathcal D_{\\{X'\\}_P}(\\mathsf{Eq}_XA,B)&\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}_P}(A,\\delta_X^*B),\\\\\n\\Phi^{\\mathfrak e}_{X,A,B}(h)&\\coloneqq\\delta_X^*(h)\\circ\\eta^X_A\n\\quad\\bigl(A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}_P},\\ B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal D_{\\{X'\\}_P}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelWeakEq}(P,Q;\\mathfrak e)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E\\quad\n\\mathsf{Eq}_X:\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}_P}\\to\\mathcal D_{\\{X'\\}_P}\\dashv_{\\eta^X,\\epsilon^X}\\delta_X^*\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall X_0,X_1\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\\ \\forall f\\in\\{g\\in\\mathcal E(X_0,X_1)\\mid\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(g)\\}\\quad\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(q;S_f;\\mathsf{Eq}_{X_0},\\Phi^{\\mathfrak e}_{X_0},\\mathsf{Eq}_{X_1},\\Phi^{\\mathfrak e}_{X_1})\\bigr)\\Bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"k_{X,Y}\\coloneqq\\overline\\delta_{X,\\mathsf{Eq}_XY}\\circ\\eta^X_Y,\n\\qquad K_{X,Y}\\coloneqq\\{k_{X,Y}\\}_Q,\n\\qquad\\pi_{\\mathsf{Eq}_XY}K_{X,Y}=\\delta_X\\pi_Y.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RelStrongEq}(P,Q;\\mathfrak e)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{RelWeakEq}(P,Q;\\mathfrak e)\\land\n\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E\\ \\forall Y\\in\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}_P}\\ \\forall B\\in\\mathcal D\\\\\n&\\forall u:\\{Y\\}_Q\\to\\{B\\}_Q\\ \\forall v:\\{\\mathsf{Eq}_XY\\}_Q\\to qB\\\\\n&\\Bigl(\\pi_Bu=vK_{X,Y}\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists!d:\\{\\mathsf{Eq}_XY\\}_Q\\to\\{B\\}_Q\\quad\ndK_{X,Y}=u\\land\\pi_Bd=v\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RelVeryStrongEq}(P,Q;\\mathfrak e)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{RelWeakEq}(P,Q;\\mathfrak e)\\land\n\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E\\ \\forall Y\\in\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}_P}\\\\\n&\\exists H:\\{\\mathsf{Eq}_XY\\}_Q\\to\\{Y\\}_Q\\quad\nHK_{X,Y}=1_{\\{Y\\}_Q}\\land K_{X,Y}H=1_{\\{\\mathsf{Eq}_XY\\}_Q}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"P=Q","display":false},{"tex":"P=Q","display":false}],"bytes":5244,"backlinks":[{"id":"5c7f9132ab843c91","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"一层理解范畴中的相等见 [[16-df-comprehension-equality]]、[[16-df-strong-equality]]；两层的相对强度见 [[16-df-identity-relative-equality]]。三种规则包之间的模型对应仍须逐包验证，不能把任意一个包自动指定为任意理解范畴的相等。"},{"id":"ec6ba39693a55895","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这是一层理解结构上的强相等：理解对角的等式伴随给出的规范理解比较可逆。所有箭头依赖同一个被量化的弱相等数据，谓词本身不再预设已选等式伴随。两层相对强度仍另见 [[16-df-identity-relative-equality]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-92","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-dtt-signature]]、[[16-df-split-dtt-structure]]、[[16-df-dtt-model]]、[[16-df-dtt-model-